---
const privacyEmail = "rahul@takovibe.com";
const mailtoHref = `mailto:${privacyEmail}?subject=ZenMode%20account%20deletion%20request&body=Please%20delete%20my%20ZenMode%20account%20and%20all%20associated%20data.%20My%20account%20email%20is%3A%20`;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
        <title>Delete Your ZenMode Account & Data</title>
        <meta
            name="description"
            content="Request deletion of your ZenMode (com.takovibe.zenmode) account and all associated data."
        />
        <style>
            body {
                max-width: 760px;
                margin: 2rem auto;
                padding: 0 1rem;
                font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: #222;
            }
            h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
            h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
            code {
                background: #f2f2f2;
                padding: 1px 5px;
                border-radius: 3px;
                font-size: 0.9em;
            }
            a { color: #c2410c; }
            a.btn {
                display: inline-block;
                background: #c2410c;
                color: #fff;
                font-weight: 600;
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 10px 18px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                margin-top: 8px;
            }
            a.btn:hover { background: #9a330a; }
            footer { margin-top: 3rem; color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1>Delete your ZenMode account and data</h1>
        <p>
            ZenMode: Focus & App Blocker — package <code>com.takovibe.zenmode</code>
        </p>

        <h2>How to request deletion</h2>
        <p>
            To delete your ZenMode account and all associated data, email us from the address
            associated with your account:
        </p>
        <a class="btn" href={mailtoHref}>Request account deletion</a>
        <p>
            Or email <a href={`mailto:${privacyEmail}`}>{privacyEmail}</a> with the subject
            "ZenMode account deletion request" and include the email address of the Google account
            you signed in with.
        </p>

        <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
        <p>When you request deletion, we permanently remove:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your account identity (the email address and name from your Google sign-in)</li>
            <li>Your focus session history and weekly statistics</li>
            <li>Your synced settings and app preferences (cloud backup)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            All of the above is stored in our cloud backup (Google Firebase) and is deleted along
            with your authentication record.
        </p>

        <h2>What we keep, and for how long</h2>
        <p>
            We do not retain any personal data after deletion, except where required by law (for
            example, transaction records related to subscription purchases, which are held by Google
            Play, not by us).
        </p>
        <p>
            Deletion requests are processed within <strong>30 days</strong> of receipt. Data held in
            routine backups is purged on our standard backup rotation.
        </p>

        <h2>Using the app without an account</h2>
        <p>
            Signing in is optional in ZenMode. If you never signed in, no personal data was sent to
            our servers — your settings and history stay on your device and are removed when you
            uninstall the app.
        </p>

        <footer>
            Questions? <a href={`mailto:${privacyEmail}`}>{privacyEmail}</a>
        </footer>
    </body>
</html>
